<title>USA: William Greenberg names CEO/president.</title>
<headline>William Greenberg names CEO/president.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Greenberg Jr Desserts and Cafes Inc said Monday it has named Philip Grabow chief executive and president following its acquisition of another company and its restructuring into a new holding company.</p>
<p>Grabow was president of J.M. Specialities Inc, which was acquired by William Greenberg Jr. J.M. Specialities does business under the name Batter Bake.</p>
<p>Stephen Fass will remain president of William Greenberg, which is now one of two wholly owned subsidiaries of the holding company. The holding company plans to change its name to Creative Foods Inc.</p>
</text>
